The new online consultation session for students, researchers, and staff at research and collection institutions covering all aspects of research data management will take place **on March 17, 2026, from 9:00 to 10:00 a.m. via Zoom.**

Going forward, experts from the humanities NFDI consortia **NFDI4Memory, NFDI4Culture, NFDI4Objects, and Text+** will be available once a month to answer your questions on all topics related to research data management.

The schedule can be found [here](https://www.nfdi.de/humanitiesnfdi/)

**Zoom:** [Link](https://uni-goettingen.zoom-x.de/j/67331197843?pwd=84wTp1UjPbjtvGpOUaNyHpWmk4ny8C.1)

